{"id":"eee9adf3edab1fc9","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-model6-amalgamation-property.md","title":"ZFC Model6 Amalgamation Property","display":"df-zfc-model6-amalgamation-property — ZFC Model6 Amalgamation Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model6-amalgamation-property","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model6-amalgamation-property"],"display":"df-zfc-model6-amalgamation-property — ZFC Model6 Amalgamation Property","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch15/58-df-injective.md]]","[[58-df-function-composition]]","[[58-df-structure]]","[[58-df-first-order-language.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model6-amalgamation-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model6-amalgamation-property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model6-amalgamation-property — ZFC Model6 Amalgamation Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8317eefb4572709e\" href=\"?note=8317eefb4572709e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-injective.md\">../batch15/58-df-injective.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"437f8f48cb6b32a3\" href=\"?note=437f8f48cb6b32a3\" title=\"58-df-function-composition\">58-df-function-composition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"58-df-first-order-language.md\">58-df-first-order-language.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,L,A,B,M_0,M_1,M_2,N,f,f_1,f_2,g_1,g_2\\in V\">\\(K,L,A,B,M_0,M_1,M_2,N,f,f_1,f_2,g_1,g_2\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L.\\mathrm{Cst},L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n,L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\">\\(L.\\mathrm{Cst},L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n,L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\)</span> (constant, function-symbol, and relation-symbol components of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"58-df-first-order-language.md\">58-df-first-order-language.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span> (structure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Injective}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Injective}_S\\)</span> (typed injective-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8317eefb4572709e\" href=\"?note=8317eefb4572709e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-injective.md\">../batch15/58-df-injective.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EmbeddingInLanguage}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{EmbeddingInLanguage}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (fixed-language embedding predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel6AmalgamationProperty}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel6AmalgamationProperty}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model6\\text{-}embedding\\text{-}in\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EmbeddingInLanguage}_S(f,A,B,L)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(A,L)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(B,L)\n\\land\\mathrm{Injective}_S(f,\\operatorname{Univ}(A),\\operatorname{Univ}(B))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall c\\in L.\\mathrm{Cst}\\;\\bigl(f(c^A)=c^B\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall h\\in L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in\\operatorname{Univ}(A)^n\\;\n\\bigl(f(h^A(\\bar a))=h^B(f\\circ\\bar a)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall R\\in L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in\\operatorname{Univ}(A)^n\\;\n\\bigl(\\bar a\\in R^A\\leftrightarrow f\\circ\\bar a\\in R^B\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model6\\text{-}embedding\\text{-}in\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EmbeddingInLanguage}_S(f,A,B,L)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(A,L)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(B,L)\n\\land\\mathrm{Injective}_S(f,\\operatorname{Univ}(A),\\operatorname{Univ}(B))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall c\\in L.\\mathrm{Cst}\\;\\bigl(f(c^A)=c^B\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall h\\in L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in\\operatorname{Univ}(A)^n\\;\n\\bigl(f(h^A(\\bar a))=h^B(f\\circ\\bar a)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall R\\in L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in\\operatorname{Univ}(A)^n\\;\n\\bigl(\\bar a\\in R^A\\leftrightarrow f\\circ\\bar a\\in R^B\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model6\\text{-}amalgamation\\text{-}property} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel6AmalgamationProperty}_S(K,L)\\leftrightarrow K\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\forall M\\in K\\;\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\\land\\forall M_0,M_1,M_2\\in K\\;\\forall f_1,f_2\\;\\Bigl((\\mathrm{EmbeddingInLanguage}_S(f_1,M_0,M_1,L)\\land\\mathrm{EmbeddingInLanguage}_S(f_2,M_0,M_2,L))\\to\\exists N\\in K\\;\\exists g_1,g_2\\;(\\mathrm{EmbeddingInLanguage}_S(g_1,M_1,N,L)\\land\\mathrm{EmbeddingInLanguage}_S(g_2,M_2,N,L)\\land g_1\\circ f_1=g_2\\circ f_2)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model6\\text{-}amalgamation\\text{-}property} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel6AmalgamationProperty}_S(K,L)\\leftrightarrow K\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\forall M\\in K\\;\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\\land\\forall M_0,M_1,M_2\\in K\\;\\forall f_1,f_2\\;\\Bigl((\\mathrm{EmbeddingInLanguage}_S(f_1,M_0,M_1,L)\\land\\mathrm{EmbeddingInLanguage}_S(f_2,M_0,M_2,L))\\to\\exists N\\in K\\;\\exists g_1,g_2\\;(\\mathrm{EmbeddingInLanguage}_S(g_1,M_1,N,L)\\land\\mathrm{EmbeddingInLanguage}_S(g_2,M_2,N,L)\\land g_1\\circ f_1=g_2\\circ f_2)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every span of embeddings in the class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> has a commuting amalgam in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>, and both objects and morphisms are explicitly fixed to the same language <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-injective.md","status":"resolved","id":"8317eefb4572709e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-injective.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function-composition","status":"resolv